Direct TF-A->Linux boot for STM32MP257F-DK (no OP-TEE, no U-Boot).

Consolidates: secondary-A35 enable, TAMP0 unlock, no IWDG1 in BL2, the
BL2 RIF/firewall hand-off + non-secure DDR (RISAF), PMIC always-on rails
+ VDDIO I/O-domain (SD card) bring-up, SDMMC kernel-clock enable, BL31
direct-kernel BL33 entry (x0=DTB), and the BL32/OP-TEE removal guards.

